# Nothing here is rewritten on the way out of git.
#
# The machine's own files -- firmware, disk images, the programs built
# for it -- are byte for byte or they are nothing, and the shell scripts
# are run by shells that want LF on every platform, including under
# MSYS2 on Windows.  A checkout that "helpfully" turned LF into CRLF
# would break both, quietly and at a distance.
* -text
